# Keeps the `containers/verify-runner` Docker build context small: its Dockerfile needs the repo
# root Cargo.toml (workspace.package inheritance) and the workspace member crates dry-core path-
# depends on transitively, but none of the build output, VCS history, or unrelated large trees below.
target
**/target
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
docs/site
py/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
